    CTEXT           "Space Plugin version 0.9 \nPascal / FlemTeam\nFor configuration right click on the Space plugin window area.\nYou could write me at dallongevillep@hotmail.com\n(Salut à Tf, Doloop, Beceka, MacDuck !!)",
